.nf
YASMV manual                                                 show-symbols

.ti 0
SYNOPSIS

.in 3
show-symbols

.ti 0
DESCRIPTION

.fi
.in 3
Inspect the loaded model's resolved state symbols, exact types, and input and
frozen flags. Validation does not require a feasible initial state, so this
command also works for models with contradictory INIT constraints.

.ti 0
EXAMPLES

.nf
.in 3
>> read-model "tests/models/query.smv"
>> show-symbols

.ti 0
SEE ALSO

.fi
.in 3
help read-model, help set, help check-init, help workspace.
